01:10:39.870 --> 01:10:40.680
Never.

01:10:40.680 --> 01:10:41.830
Now!

01:10:41.830 --> 01:10:45.290
Lost.

01:10:45.290 --> 01:10:48.340
If you want something done, you gotta do it yourself.

01:10:48.340 --> 01:10:56.160
Wh-wh-wh-what are you doing?

01:10:56.160 --> 01:11:00.000
You may not be Toby, but you're still my son.

01:11:00.280 --> 01:11:25.610
dad now fly fly arrest them immediately i want them shot for treason we're gonna have to use

01:11:25.610 --> 01:11:30.000
the peacekeeper to get the blue core back don't use the red core the negative energy we got

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:33.600
can't know how it will behave doctor in any conflict between positive and

01:11:33.600 --> 01:11:38.830
negative energy the negative always prevails look at human history look at

01:11:38.830 --> 01:11:44.260
me my point exactly turn this thing on I won't I have 50 reporters waiting

01:11:44.260 --> 01:11:49.100
outside turn it on you don't understand the technology technology who cares

01:11:49.100 --> 01:11:54.080
about technology who understands technology it's a robot it'll do what I

01:11:54.080 --> 01:12:00.000
say record loaded you ready to do as you're

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:02.080
You ready to rock and roll?

01:12:02.080 --> 01:12:03.080
Sir!

01:12:03.080 --> 01:12:05.390
Destroy the boy robot!

01:12:05.390 --> 01:12:07.660
Bring back the blue core!

01:12:07.660 --> 01:12:13.190
Deaf!

01:12:13.190 --> 01:12:15.530
I told you to destroy the boy robot!

01:12:15.530 --> 01:12:20.890
And bring back the blue core!

01:12:20.890 --> 01:12:22.260
Everybody out!

01:12:22.260 --> 01:12:23.120
Now!

01:12:34.600 --> 01:12:37.920
I'm sorry, guys. I'm getting word that President Stone may be slightly delayed.

01:12:47.830 --> 01:12:48.950
Is this a song on?

01:12:48.950 --> 01:12:53.260
Huh? Where are you going?

01:12:53.260 --> 01:12:55.070
Come back! Monster!

01:12:55.070 --> 01:12:56.330
Stand down!

01:12:56.330 --> 01:12:58.480
My order of President Stone!

01:13:02.520 --> 01:13:05.520
This is a life, buddy. Smooth sailing.

01:13:07.540 --> 01:13:09.040
Sorry, guys.

01:13:09.040 --> 01:13:12.040
Oh, no! It's that crazy flying kid again!

01:13:12.040 --> 01:13:14.800
I'm a robot, just like you.

01:13:14.800 --> 01:13:17.020
Well, what are you doing all the way out here?

01:13:17.020 --> 01:13:18.920
We got tired of the rat race. We dropped out.

01:13:18.920 --> 01:13:21.870
We're trying to live more natural, you know, like real birds.

01:13:21.870 --> 01:13:24.230
What's that?

01:13:24.230 --> 01:13:26.230
You know what humans are like.

01:13:26.230 --> 01:13:29.240
New Year's, Fourth of July, Mother's Day.

01:13:29.240 --> 01:13:30.000
We've gotta do something.

01:13:30.090 --> 01:13:32.980
Help the humans? We're robots, it's not our problem!

01:13:32.980 --> 01:13:43.650
Yeah, forgot about them! What did they ever do for us?

01:13:43.650 --> 01:13:46.760
Right. According to the rules of robotics, we gotta go help.

01:13:46.760 --> 01:13:51.100
A squeezy bottle's gotta do what a squeezy bottle's gotta do.

01:13:57.330 --> 01:13:59.250
Wherever you are!

01:14:05.790 --> 01:14:16.770
do do do do do do do do do do do where are you robot boy

01:14:51.600 --> 01:14:53.750
I don't care if he's a robot.

01:14:53.750 --> 01:14:55.200
I miss him.

01:14:55.200 --> 01:15:00.000
I hear ya.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:02.370
If it gets tough, smart people take a hike.

01:15:02.370 --> 01:15:03.720
Bye-bye, kids.

01:15:03.720 --> 01:15:05.800
What do you want, an apology?

01:15:05.800 --> 01:15:07.300
Just the car.

01:15:07.300 --> 01:15:09.300
I would love to oblige you, but-

01:15:10.370 --> 01:15:14.830
C'mon, I love you guys!

01:15:14.830 --> 01:15:18.210
Please, call off the freakin' robots!

01:15:22.150 --> 01:15:23.680
The car!

01:15:23.680 --> 01:15:26.280
Huh?

01:15:33.100 --> 01:15:35.500
This city elected me!

01:15:35.500 --> 01:15:37.090
I own it!

01:15:37.090 --> 01:15:38.720
It's mine!

01:15:57.000 --> 01:15:59.700
