01:25:46.670 --> 01:25:50.060
Everybody take cover! We're under alien attack!

01:25:52.210 --> 01:25:54.990
Wait, are you sure you're ready for this, Astro?

01:25:54.990 --> 01:25:56.440
I was made ready.
